+        // THE R1 FIX: the host's section 4 lives from the emit until the host has LOADED the announced field (its field-load hook, before
+        // Main_Init), its body stands there, 2 s have passed since the emit and 1 s since that landing. It ends early when the host lands
+        // elsewhere, leaves after landing (a battle's swirl reads off the field), or never lands within 10 s. It never reads "is the old map
